re, planting methods, growth principles. So the most relevant content types would be:\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - practical care steps\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - growth principles\n- 概念速览 (concept overviews) - concepts\n\nThe \"市场观察\" (market observation) content is explicitly excluded per the interest description (花店经营/庭院工程报价). The \"专题观察\" content about naming history, garden aesthetics, exhibitions is less aligned with home plant care.\n\nLet me identify the relevant candidates. The interest is 阳台园艺 (balcony gardening). The candidates span various settings: 半阴窗台, 朝南阳台, 通风露台, 夏季室内. The user's interest is about balcony gardening specifically.\n\nLet me focus on candidates that are about home plant care methods and principles, and avoid market observation content.\n\nLet me count the candidates and categorize. Given the large number, I need to select 20 that best match the interest.\n\nThe interest: 阳台园艺，关注家庭植物养护、种植方法和生长原理 (balcony gardening, focusing on home plant care, planting methods, growth principles), NOT flower shop operations or garden engineering quotes.\n\nSo I should prefer:\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - practical care\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - growth principles\n- 概念速览 (concept overviews) - concepts\n\nAnd avoid:\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - flower shop pricing, engineering quotes (explicitly excluded)\n- 专题观察 (special topic) - naming history, aesthetics, exhibitions (less relevant to home care)\n\nLet me select 20 candidates that are operation records, conditions/principles, and concept overviews, focusing on balcony settings (朝南阳台, 通风露台, 半阴窗台) which match \"阳台\" (balcony) interest.\n\nActually the interest is 阳台园艺 (balcony gardening). Settings include 半阴窗台 (window sill), 朝南阳台 (south-facing balcony), 通风露台 (ventilated terrace), 夏季室内 (summer indoor). The most aligned with \"balcony\" would be 朝南阳台 and 通风露台. But window sill and indoor are also home plant care contexts.\n\nLet me select a balanced set of 20 candidates that are 